T368	Quotation 67564 67638	"But I must! DON'T groan so, Tom, it's awful. How long you been this way?"
T369	Quotation 67639 67693	"Hours. Ouch! Oh, don't stir so, Sid, you'll kill me."
T370	Quotation 67694 67809	"Tom, why didn't you wake me sooner? Oh, Tom, DON'T! It makes my flesh crawl to hear you. Tom, what is the matter?"
T371	Quotation 67810 67904	"I forgive you everything, Sid. [Groan.] Everything you've ever done to me. When I'm gone -- "
