T390	Entity 68924 68927	she
T391	Cue 68928 68932	said
T392	Quotation 68934 69022	"Tom, what a turn you did give me. Now you shut up that nonsense and climb out of this."
T393	Entity 69112 69114	he
T394	Cue 69115 69119	said
